  body: "The default ReferenceBlackWhite is wrong. The table says `(0, 255, 0, 128, 0, 128)` but per the TIFF 6.0 spec and libtiff/Pillow, the default for 8-bit YCbCr is `(0, 255, 128, 255, 128, 255)`. The notes below repeat the same error (\"Cb black/white = 0/128\" should be \"128/255\").",
  path: "tests/YCBCR_SUPPORT.md",
  line: 19,
  side: "RIGHT",
  subjectType: "LINE",
  owner, repo, pullNumber,
});

// Inline comment 2: YCbCrSubsampling default
await tools.github.add_comment_to_pending_review({
  body: "The default for YCbCrSubsampling is wrong. The TIFF 6.0 spec states: \"The default values of this field are [2, 2].\" This says \"1, 1\" which contradicts the spec.",
  path: "tests/YCBCR_SUPPORT.md",
  line: 17,
  side: "RIGHT",
  subjectType: "LINE",
  owner, repo, pullNumber,
});

// Inline comment 3: Reverse conversion formula for B
await tools.github.add_comment_to_pending_review({
  body: "The reverse conversion formula for B has an extra term. The standard BT.601 inverse is: `B = Y + 1.772 * (Cb - 128)`. The `- 0.081312 * (Cr - 128)` term is incorrect and should be removed.",
  path: "tests/YCBCR_SUPPORT.md",
  line: 46,
  side: "RIGHT",
  subjectType: "LINE",
  owner, repo, pullNumber,
});

