entryStream << entry;
CHECK(contains(entryStream.str(), "Tag:"));
CHECK(contains(entryStream.str(), "Type:"));
CHECK(contains(entryStream.str(), "Count:"));
CHECK(contains(entryStream.str(), "Value:"));
```

All good. The test covers all the stream operators.

